    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "86B5CA9CF60274D5",
      "text": "¿Qué tal el viaje que hiciste con Cass\\ny compañía?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "7D7A79D5E660C5B4",
      "text": "¡Nada, un paseo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "7D7A7CD5E660CACD",
      "text": "¡Bastante movidito!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "86B5C79CF6026FBC",
      "text": "Tratándose de ti, no podía ser de otra manera.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_02b",
      "hash64": "E9520DB60624163A",
      "text": "¡Ya me imagino! Tienes que estar agotad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "86B5C89CF602716F",
      "text": "Ir a explorar el enorme foso de Paldea tuvo que\\nser toda una aventura.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "86B5C59CF6026C56",
      "text": "Aunque, ahora que lo pienso... ¿No es un poco\\ninjusto que te llevaran de excursión a Paldea?\\r\\nSi tú mism[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa vienes de allí...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_03",
      "hash64": "7D7A7BD5E660C91A",
      "text": "¡No pasa nada!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_04",
      "hash64": "7D7A76D5E660C09B",
      "text": "Pues es verdad...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "86B5C69CF6026E09",
      "text": "Hay que ver lo madur[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa que eres. Yo me quejaría,\\nsin duda.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "E94EE7B606219FD1",
      "text": "¿A que sí? ¡Me alegra que estés de acuerdo!\\n¡Lo que te han hecho no está nada bien![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "86B5C39CF60268F0",
      "text": "Hay veces que en esta academia se toman\\ndemasiadas libertades.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "86B5C49CF6026AA3",
      "text": "Por eso creo que es nuestro deber alzar la voz\\ncuando algo nos parece mal.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "584CCB84E90DCCB5",
      "text": "¿Tienes un momento, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "584CCA84E90DCB02",
      "text": "Me gustaría informarte acerca de los cambios\\nocurridos en el Club de la Liga en tu ausencia.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "584CC984E90DC94F",
      "text": "Primero, para evitar posibles confusiones, se han\\nsuspendido temporalmente los cambios en la\\r\\nclasificación de la Liga Arándano.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "584CC884E90DC79C",
      "text": "También se ha añadido oficialmente una regla\\nnueva: los estudiantes de intercambio también\\r\\npueden optar al título de Campeón.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "584CC784E90DC5E9",
      "text": "Por otra parte, las normas tan estrictas que había\\nimpuesto Cass se han abolido por completo.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "584CC684E90DC436",
      "text": "¡Bueno, ha pasado todo eso y mucho más!\\nNo hemos parado, como quien dice.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "0D491132F0304C51",
      "text": "Gracias por todo",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "0D490E32F0304738",
      "text": "Menudo trabajazo",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "584CC584E90DC283",
      "text": "Ah, perdona, no era mi intención fardar...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "584CC484E90DC0D0",
      "text": "Al fin y al cabo, es nuestra responsabilidad que\\nel club funcione como es debido...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "584CD384E90DDA4D",
      "text": "Ojalá el impresentable de Levi ayudase en vez\\nde dormirse en las reuniones, también te digo...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_09",
      "hash64": "584CD284E90DD89A",
      "text": "¡Bueno, esas son todas las novedades![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "AFF8958C858C4FC4",
      "text": "¡[VAR 0x0100(0000)]! ¿Tienes un segundo?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "AFF8968C858C5177",
      "text": "Verás, durante el tiempo que Cass fue Campeón,\\nel ambiente en el club estaba bastante tenso...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "AFF8978C858C532A",
      "text": "Y, a causa de ello, muchos de nuestros miembros\\ndejaron de participar en las actividades.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "AFF8988C858C54DD",
      "text": "Así que... ¡me gustaría que me ayudases a\\nestablecer una nueva dirección para el club![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "AFF8918C858C48F8",
      "text": "¿Tienes alguna idea?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "30EE3D64CC124D0E",
      "text": "¡Esfuerzo y diversión!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "30EE3C64CC124B5B",
      "text": "¡Entusiasmo y alegría!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "30EE3B64CC1249A8",
      "text": "¡Seguridad y sensatez!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "AFF8928C858C4AAB",
      "text": "¿Esfuerzo y diversión? ¡Me gusta![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
